1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,200
Days of the Week with Mimo!

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:11,975
Mimo: Hi friends! There are seven days in a week. Let's spend a whole week together and learn all the days!

3
00:00:12,275 --> 00:00:14,879
Bruno: Seven days? That's a lot of snack times!

4
00:00:19,379 --> 00:00:22,076
Mimo: On Monday, we paint pictures!

5
00:00:22,376 --> 00:00:25,655
Lulu: I painted a house! Monday is a painting day!

6
00:00:25,955 --> 00:00:27,543
Mimo: Can you say Monday?

7
00:00:31,643 --> 00:00:34,767
Mimo: On Tuesday, we play at the playground!

8
00:00:36,338 --> 00:00:38,925
Pip: Catch the ball! Tuesday is so much fun!

9
00:00:39,225 --> 00:00:40,795
Mimo: Can you say Tuesday?

10
00:00:44,895 --> 00:00:47,631
Mimo: On Wednesday, we go to the beach!

11
00:00:47,931 --> 00:00:51,405
Bruno: Look at my sandcastle! It's the best sandcastle ever!

12
00:00:51,705 --> 00:00:54,169
Bruno: Oh no! The wave took my sandcastle!

13
00:00:56,469 --> 00:00:58,069
Mimo: Can you say Wednesday?

14
00:01:02,169 --> 00:01:04,880
Mimo: On Thursday, we make pancakes!

15
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:08,433
Bruno: Thursday is my favorite day! Pancakes, pancakes!

16
00:01:10,333 --> 00:01:11,929
Mimo: Can you say Thursday?

17
00:01:16,029 --> 00:01:18,655
Mimo: On Friday, we have a dance party!

18
00:01:20,955 --> 00:01:23,461
Lulu: Friday is the dancing day!

19
00:01:23,761 --> 00:01:25,276
Mimo: Can you say Friday?

20
00:01:29,376 --> 00:01:33,008
Mimo: On Saturday, we go camping under the stars!

21
00:01:33,308 --> 00:01:35,840
Bruno: And we roast marshmallows by the campfire. Yum!

22
00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:37,769
Mimo: Can you say Saturday?

23
00:01:41,869 --> 00:01:45,719
Mimo: And on Sunday, we rest and read a book together.

24
00:01:47,819 --> 00:01:50,132
Bruno: After a busy week, I'm sleepy.

25
00:01:50,432 --> 00:01:52,050
Mimo: Can you say Sunday?

26
00:01:53,950 --> 00:01:57,680
Mimo: Now let's say all seven days together! Ready?

27
00:01:57,980 --> 00:01:58,968
Mimo: Monday!

28
00:01:59,568 --> 00:02:00,415
Pip: Tuesday!

29
00:02:01,015 --> 00:02:01,969
Bruno: Wednesday!

30
00:02:02,569 --> 00:02:03,859
Lulu: Thursday!

31
00:02:04,459 --> 00:02:05,344
Pip: Friday!

32
00:02:05,944 --> 00:02:06,716
Bruno: Saturday!

33
00:02:07,316 --> 00:02:08,605
Mimo: And Sunday!

34
00:02:10,205 --> 00:02:14,498
Mimo: Great job, friends! Seven days make one whole week!

35
00:02:14,798 --> 00:02:17,819
Bruno: And then it starts again! More pancakes on Thursday!

36
00:02:20,119 --> 00:02:23,498
Mimo: Bye bye, friends! See you next week!
